ull,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[64,60,71,57,58,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"2400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1000205","helmet":"WP1019105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1044","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[64,60,71,57,58,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1000205","helmet":"WP1019105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10120","city":"CS1043","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[64,60,71,57,58,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1000205","helmet":"WP1019105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"南蛮智者，由孟优荐于孟获以对抗蜀军。虽然朵思大王利用地势与毒泉屡次击退蜀军，但因杨锋叛变投蜀，故被其所擒后交予蜀军。朵思被放回后，又于三江城用毒箭再次将蜀军击退，但在诸葛亮的激励下，蜀军筑起土墙后突破了防线，朵思大王在乱战中被杀。","tc":"南蠻智者，由孟優薦于孟獲以對抗蜀軍。雖然朵思大王利用地勢與毒泉屢次擊退蜀軍，但因楊鋒叛變投蜀，故被其所擒后交予蜀軍。朵思被放回后，又于三江城用毒箭再次將蜀軍擊退，但在諸葛亮的激勵下，蜀軍筑起土墻后突破了防線，朵思大王在亂戰中被殺。","en":"A sage of the Nanman tribes, recommended by Meng You to Meng Huo to help counter the Shu army. Although King Duosi exploited the terrain and poisonous springs to repeatedly repel the Shu forces, Yang Feng's betrayal and defection to Shu led to his capture and delivery to the Shu army. After being released, Duosi used poisoned arrows at Sanjiang Castle to repel the Shu forces once more. However, spurred by Zhuge Liang's encouragement, the Shu troops erected earthen walls and broke through the defenses, and King Duosi was killed in the ensuing melee.","jp":"南蛮の知者。孟優の推挙により孟獲に仕えて蜀軍に対抗した。朶思大王は地勢の利と毒泉を駆使して幾度も蜀軍を撃退したものの、蜀に寝返った楊鋒に捕らえられ、蜀軍へと引き渡された。釈放された後は三江城にて毒矢を用いて再び蜀軍を退けたが、諸葛亮の激励を受けた蜀軍が土壁を築いて防衛線を突破し、朶思大王は乱戦の中で討ち取られた。","kr":"남만의 지략가로, 촉군에 맞서기 위해 맹우의 천거를 받아 맹획을 보좌했다. 지세와 독천을 활용해 촉군을 여러 차례 격퇴했으나, 양봉이 배반하여 촉에 투항하는 바람에 그에게 사로잡혀 촉군에 넘겨졌다. 풀려난 뒤 삼강성에서 독화살을 사용하여 촉군을 다시 물리쳤으나, 제갈량의 독려를 받은 촉군이 토벽을 쌓고 방어선을 돌파하자 난전 중에 목숨을 잃었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10668","remark":"","surname":"朵思","surnameTc":"朵思","surnameEn":"Duosi","surnameJp":"朶思","surnameKr":"타사","surnameOther":"","name":"大王","nameTc":"大王","nameEn":"King","nameJp":"大王","nameKr":"대왕","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"朵思大王","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"217","city":"CS1044","gender":"0","rule":"64","force":"60","wise":"71","politics":"57","charm":"58","will":"52","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"21/21/61/21/21/52/50/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4000","battleSoulPoint":"3600","debateSoulPoint":"5000","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"1/0/0/3/0/0/1/0/1/1/2/2/1/0/0/1/2/3/2/2/0/1/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"40","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"186","show":"217","death":"225","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1000205","helmet":"WP1019105","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;2/1;13/1;18/1;26/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"南蛮智者，由孟优荐于孟获以对抗蜀军。虽然朵思大王利用地势与毒泉屡次击退蜀军，但因杨锋叛变投蜀，故被其所擒后交予蜀军。朵思被放回后，又于三江城用毒箭再次将蜀军击退，但在诸葛亮的激励下，蜀军